</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.33</h2><ul><li><strong>About these figures is two groups.</strong> Opening that line at the bottom of the Token spend window shows the estimate and the sources with no usage data as separate groups; those source names wrap, and the heading shows how many there are. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/95">#95</a></li><li><strong>Mission Control can select the Token spend window.</strong> A three-finger swipe up, then a click on that window, brings it forward. Clicking another app&#x27;s window still leaves Token spend behind. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/95">#95</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.33">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
